# What `vercel deploy` from the repo root must never upload. The site builds
# from frontend/ but installs siblings, so the whole checkout is the upload.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.env
**/*.key
backend/.stack
backend/deploy/config
backend/mesh/deploy/config
**/node_modules
contracts/lib
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/broadcast
**/.graphclient
